es easier  to remember  and wanted to reduce the stigma of using  country-based  labels in vietnam authorities are  tightening restrictions after detecting  what they call  a very dangerous hybrid variant the  country's health minister says the new  highly transmissible variant appears to  be a combination  of the alpha and delta variants first  detected in the uk and india  it may be partly responsible for the  country's spike in cases  vietnam had kept lumber numbers low  throughout the pandemic but  international flights into the capital  are now suspended  and a mass testing campaign is underway  in ho chi minh city  ahead why israel's political rivals are  banding together to  unseat the prime minister  the longest-serving prime minister of  israel is on increasingly  shaky ground rivals of benjamin  netanyahu are joining together to form a  coalition to unseat him  they are not political allies and have  little in common except their desire to  no longer have netanyahu running the  country  crystal gomencing looks at the political  upheaval underway  in israel tonight after 12 years in  power  benjamin netanyahu has mastered out  maneuvering his opponents  but his reign in israel may be coming to  an end  so i think it's a very dramatic moment  for for israel  and politics and for bennett himself  he's taking a huge gamble  this man naftalny bennett a far-right  politician announced sunday  he's joining forces with centrist yair  lepid  to dethrone netanyahu god willing  together we can rescue the country from  its tailspin and return it on its path  it's a path full of roadblocks according  to lapid but one the country  needs to travel in tacoma  if this government is formed he said the  key word will be  responsibility to take responsibility to  restore  inner calm not blame others not look for  enemies  after 11 days of bombings that killed  more than 250 people  most of them in gaza a ceasefire is  holding  allowing the opportunity for this new  coalition 